  "version": 1,
  "comment": "One-step production recipes for eras 1-2 (GDD 4.4; CORE simplified: no chains yet). A group of 'workers' turns the inputs into the outputs in 'years'. Amounts have at most 2 decimal places. The stratum that works and the technology that unlocks a recipe are added with population (3b) and technologies (3f).",
